{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841900/extras/bf52af61ad51cf908d84c336ba11be38.poster.avif?t=1758127863\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841900/extras/bf52af61ad51cf908d84c336ba11be38.webm?t=1758127863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841900/extras/bf52af61ad51cf908d84c336ba11be38.mp4?t=1758127863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841900/extras/3ae0e60866d84c6ff644e2616ce9f689.avif?t=1758127863\" data-has-big width=1560 height=519 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create custom boards with new layouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not limited to the standard pieces, let your creativity out</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with an aggressive forward assault, Or perhaps a defensive fortress designed to weather the storm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's like chess but with deckbuilding and dragons...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you outwit, outmanoeuvre, or out-explode your way to victory?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841900/extras/a0a1c0f746167b1b5d27365ae87c77b8.avif?t=1758127863\" data-has-big width=1560 height=652 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fusefort</strong>: Explodes on capturing/capture, destroying all pieces on that square and to the sides</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spearman</strong>: pawn who can sidestep and lunge forward to attack 2 spaces ahead</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cracked</strong> Pawn: a cheaper &amp; weaker pawn, allowing you to purchase more powerful pieces elsewhere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warden</strong>: A castle that somehow learned to jump, though now he can only reach 2 spaces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dragon</strong>: Breathes fire destroying all 3 pieces in front, even your own</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And many more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Pieces:</strong>\u00a013+ new chess pieces and counting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom board crafting</strong>: Craft the ultimate formation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenges</strong>: Handcrafted challenges to test your creations against</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ranked and Leaderboards</strong>: Show off your skills by playing ranked and becoming the best in the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online / AI:</strong> Test strategies against AI, or play online</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3841900?t=1758127863","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841900/1edc9e8d2012752acc48588c1b8a0e08a6663bc4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758127863","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841900/ceb47f14fdc756e6f0e57f3c40bbeb657d13a742/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758127863","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841900/ceb47f14fdc756e6f0e57f3c40bbeb657d13a742/capsule_184x69.jpg?